- Bshouty, N. H. and Jackson, J. C. (1999). Learning DNF over the uniform distribution using a
  quantum example oracle. *SIAM Journal on Computing* 28, 1136–1153.
- Blum, A., Kalai, A. and Wasserman, H. (2003). Noise-tolerant learning, the parity problem, and
